{"tools":[{"name":"discover","description":"Pass sandboxId to explore a sandbox; omit it for the live warehouse. Discover live warehouse bodies, availability, sensor/inspection and handling limits, lease limits and bounds. Start here. Coordinates are in meters; y is up. Includes shared survey grid history and known cargo from actual observations; use unknown checkpoints and static navigation geometry to plan your own search. Read surveyGuide before interpreting coverage.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["camera","rover","arm","drone"]},"sandboxId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"possess","description":"Pass sandboxId to possess a draft sandbox device; its lease routes observe/act/release automatically. Acquire an exclusive expiring lease on a body. Keep the returned opaque leaseId private. Default 60s, range 5–300s. Set owner to an agent display name.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"resourceId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"sandboxId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"ttlSeconds":{"default":60,"type":"integer","minimum":5,"maximum":300},"owner":{"default":"MCP agent","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":48}},"required":["resourceId"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"observe","description":"Observe through the possessed body's sensors. Returns pose, limits, analytic cargo telemetry, last inspection, action completion and shared survey history. Stationary observations credit visible floor checkpoints; motion polls do not credit a swept path. Set image:true for a server-rendered 640x360 body camera JPEG as MCP image content, plus an embedded viewer in MCP Apps hosts. Frames are frozen at their reported revision; image visibility includes scenery occlusion while cargo telemetry uses range and static-obstacle line-of-sight checks.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"leaseId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"image":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["leaseId"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"outputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"at":{"type":"number"},"revision":{"type":"number"},"body":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":{}},"objects":{"type":"array","items":{}},"inspection":{},"limits":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"survey":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"frame":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}},"context":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["at","revision","body","objects","inspection","limits","survey"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"_meta":{"ui/resourceUri":"ui://views/body-view.html","ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://views/body-view.html"}}},{"name":"act","description":"Control a possessed body with a typed command. move: rover x/z or airborne drone x/y/z. look: fixed camera or drone gimbal pan/tilt in degrees. inspect: visible nearby cargo. arm: preset home/reach/drop, grasp objectId, place; choose drop before placing in dispatch. Drone: takeoff/land. stop cancels motion. Poll observe for completion. Use observations to find cargo and decide where to move; direct paths are checked against static obstacles and body clearance; PATH_BLOCKED rejects the entire motion. Use discover navigation geometry to choose aisle waypoints. Drone look pan/tilt aims its gimbal in world degrees without changing flight or replacing a running motion.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"leaseId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"command":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"move"},"x":{"type":"number"},"z":{"type":"number"},"y":{"type":"number"}},"required":["type","x","z"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"look"},"pan":{"type":"number","minimum":-180,"maximum":180},"tilt":{"type":"number","minimum":-90,"maximum":30}},"required":["type","pan","tilt"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"inspect"},"objectId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80}},"required":["type","objectId"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"preset"},"preset":{"type":"string","enum":["home","reach","drop"]}},"required":["type","preset"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"grasp"},"objectId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80}},"required":["type","objectId"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"place"}},"required":["type"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"takeoff"}},"required":["type"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"land"}},"required":["type"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"stop"}},"required":["type"],"additionalProperties":false}]}},"required":["leaseId","command"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"release","description":"Release a lease and cancel its pending motion. Repeated release is harmless. A drone holds its last altitude, and a held crate stays attached.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"leaseId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100}},"required":["leaseId"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"sandbox_list","description":"List isolated warehouse draft sandboxes, recent experiment runs, retention limits and model assumptions. Start experiment design here. Drafts and reports are in memory; export JSON to keep them.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"sandbox_create","description":"Clone the live warehouse, another sandbox (sourceSandboxId), or a version-1 imported definition into an independent draft. No source leases/actions/inspection history are copied. Operator/design tools expose complete scenario cargo, unlike body sensor discovery.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"sourceSandboxId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"definition":{"type":"object","properties":{"version":{"type":"number","const":1},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"obstacles":{"maxItems":128,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"label":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["rack","wall","column","freight","mezzanine"]},"min":{"type":"array","prefixItems":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"number"}],"items":false,"minItems":3,"maxItems":3},"max":{"type":"array","prefixItems":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"number"}],"items":false,"minItems":3,"maxItems":3}},"